From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: koalabuttz <27229333+koalabuttz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 09:49:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: name the physics object id casts

A physics body is kept in int fields (DynEntityClient, the MP cpose_t,
FxElem, BreakablePiece) and cast back with (dxBody *) at each use. The
casts now go through Phys_IdFromObj() and Phys_ObjFromId() in the new
physics/phys_objid.h, 38 uses in nine files.

No behaviour change: both helpers are the same casts. It leaves one
place to change when a pointer no longer fits the field. The SP
cpose_t keeps its pointer sized field and is not touched.
---
